     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div><br></div><div>When running a shiny application is there any way to catch the way in which the application is stopped? I have a GUI sequence that runs until stopApp() is called, but I would like to know if the user has accidentally closed the application early (e.g., by closing the web browser prior to the stopApp() call). I figure there is a trigger/signal being sent somewhere which can be tracked, but I can&#39;t quite find it. Any help would be appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>Phil</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
